### How to use it in `engine.ts`

**1. Import**
```ts
import { NPCBillboard } from "./npc-billboard";
```

**2. Create the Cyber-Ninja**

```ts
this.ninja = new NPCBillboard(
  this.videoManager,
  this.camera,
  "cyberNinja",
  "/npcs/cyber_ninja_idle.mp4",
  new THREE.Vector3(14, 1.8, 9),   // position in your palace
  2.5,                             // width
  3.8                              // height
);
```

**3. Update every frame**

Inside your `visual(dt)` or main loop:

```ts
this.ninja.update();   // makes him always face the player
```

**4. Optional controls**
```ts
// Pause when far away (performance)
if (distanceToPlayer > 35) {
  this.ninja.pause();
} else {
  this.ninja.play();
}
```

